  "body": "To download the documents for this property, copy and paste the following link into your browser: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/KSLG\r\n\r\nIf you're looking for something modern, easy to look after and close to everything Orewa has to offer, this one is well worth a look. Set one back from the road and around 600m from the beach, the home offers a great mix of privacy, convenience and low-maintenance living.\r\n\r\nInside the layout is light, practical and easy to live in, with open-plan living creating a comfortable space to relax or entertain. It would make a great permanent home, coastal retreat, investment or lockup and leave, and there is also the option to purchase the home fully furnished, ideal if you're coming from overseas or simply want to move in and start enjoying it.\r\n\r\nThe location really does make life easy. Orewa Beach, cafes, restaurants, shops, supermarkets and schools are all close by, along with parks, coastal walkways and easy motorway access. Whether it's a morning walk along the beach, grabbing a coffee in town or heading away for the weekend, everything is right on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nOur vendors have made the decision to head overseas and are ready to move on, so don't be afraid to make an offer, you may be pleasantly surprised.",
